From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: Use track durations to identify finite HTTP MP4 files.

avformat_open_input() initializes AVFormatContext.duration to AV_NOPTS_VALUE.
The MOV demuxer fills AVStream.duration from the MP4 track headers; the
aggregate duration is not populated until avformat_find_stream_info().

The progressive HTTP path checked the aggregate duration immediately after
opening and latched nonseekable for ordinary finite MP4 files. This then
discarded the valid result of get_context_duration(), omitted MF_PD_DURATION
and MFMEDIASOURCE_CAN_SEEK, and made later seek requests silently succeed
without moving the demuxer.

The VRChat reproducer resolves to an HTTP 206 MP4 with Content-Length
7847298, H.264/AAC tracks and approximately 183 seconds of media. The log
shows decoder negotiation followed by a query for the missing MF_PD_DURATION
and release of the source reader without reading a sample.

Use the existing track-aware duration helper for the progressive source
classification too. Retain the non-seekable transport check and require
a known resource length as well as a positive duration, so an unbounded
fragmented stream cannot be mistaken for a finite file based on the first
fragment's duration. Keep this decision before stream probing, which can
otherwise produce a misleading duration for live inputs.

Header-only reproduction with the existing fixture (no download needed):
  ffprobe -v error -nofind_stream_info -show_entries \
    format=duration:stream=duration -of json dlls/mfreadwrite/tests/test.mp4
The tracks report 1 second while format.duration is absent. With normal
stream probing, format.duration is also 1 second.

Reference: https://ffmpeg.org/doxygen/trunk/structAVFormatContext.html

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
--- a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
@@ -903,9 +903,12 @@ NTSTATUS demuxer_create( void *arg )
             ERR( "Failed to open remote URL, error %s.\n", debugstr_averr(ret) );
             goto failed;
         }
+        /* MP4 track durations are available at open, but the aggregate duration
+         * is only populated by avformat_find_stream_info(). Do not discard the
+         * track durations of finite files, or trust a live fragment's duration. */
         if (progressive && (!demuxer->ctx->pb ||
                 !(demuxer->ctx->pb->seekable & AVIO_SEEKABLE_NORMAL) ||
-                demuxer->ctx->duration == AV_NOPTS_VALUE))
+                avio_size( demuxer->ctx->pb ) < 0 || get_context_duration( demuxer->ctx ) <= 0))
             demuxer->nonseekable = TRUE;
         else if (!hls && get_context_duration( demuxer->ctx ) == AV_NOPTS_VALUE && (rtsp ||
                 (demuxer->ctx->pb && !(demuxer->ctx->pb->seekable & AVIO_SEEKABLE_NORMAL)
